\":\"#E1E4E8\",\"--shiki-light\":\"#1F2328\"},\"children\":\"};\"}]}]]}]]}]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"Hopefully that looks good enough to you.\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading mt-8 scroll-m-28 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"What about nested lists?\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"Nested lists basically always look bad which is why editors like Medium don't even let you do it, but I guess since some of you goofballs are going to do it we have to carry the burden of at least making it work.\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-decimal\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":\"Nested lists are rarely a good idea.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-disc\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"You might feel like you are being really \\\"organized\\\" or something but you are just creating a gross shape on the screen that is hard to read.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Nested navigation in UIs is a bad idea too, keep things as flat as possible.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Nesting tons of folders in your source code is also not helpful.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":\"Since we need to have more items, here's another one.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-disc\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"I'm not sure if we'll bother styling more than two levels deep.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Two is already too much, three is guaranteed to be a bad idea.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"If you nest four levels deep you belong in prison.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":\"Two items isn't really a list, three is good though.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-disc\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Again please don't nest lists if you want people to actually read your content.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Nobody wants to look at this.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"I'm upset that we even have to bother styling this.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":[\"The most annoying thing about lists in Markdown is that \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\",\"children\":\"<li>\"}],\" elements aren't given a child \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\",\"children\":\"<p>\"}],\" tag unless there are multiple paragraphs in the list item. That means I have to worry about styling that annoying situation too.\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-disc\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":\"For example, here's another nested list.\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"But this time with a second paragraph.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-disc\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"These list items won't have \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\",\"children\":\"<p>\"}],\" tags\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Because they are only one line each\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":\"But in this second top-level list item, they will.\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"This is especially annoying because of the spacing on this paragraph.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 ml-6 list-disc\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":[\"As you can see here, because I've added a second line, this list item now has a \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-muted relative rounded-md px-[0.3rem] py-[0.1rem] font-mono outline-none\",\"children\":\"<p>\"}],\" tag.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"This is the second line I'm talking about by the way.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"Finally here's another list item so it's more like a list.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"A closing list item, but with no nested list, because why not?\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"And finally a sentence to close off this section.\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"there-are-other-elements-we-need-to-style\",\"className\":\"font-heading mt-12 scroll-m-28 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight first:mt-0 lg:mt-20 [&+p]:!mt-4\",\"children\":\"There are other elements we need to style\"}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":[\"I almost forgot to mention links, like \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium underline underline-offset-4\",\"href\":\"https://tailwindcss.com\",\"children\":\"this link to the Tailwind CSS website\"}],\". We almost made them blue but that's so yesterday, so we went with dark gray, feels edgier.\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"leading-relaxed [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6\",\"children\":\"We even included table styles, check it out:\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 w-full overflow-y-auto\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-full overflow-hidden border-none text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"last:border-b-none m-0 border-b\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-2 text-left font-bold [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right\",\"children\":\"Wrestler\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-2 text-left font-bold [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right\",\"children\":\"Origin\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-2 text-left font-bold [&[align=center]]:text-center [&[align=right]]:text-right\",\"children\":\"Finisher\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"last:border-b-none m-0 border-b\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"